{"id":"5214366b706950b4","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-abstract-truth-set.md","title":"Truth Sets for Abstract Provability Systems","display":"df-abstract-truth-set — Truth Sets for Abstract Provability Systems","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-abstract-truth-set","aliases":["92-df-abstract-truth-set"],"display":"df-abstract-truth-set — Truth Sets for Abstract Provability Systems","source":"第 XI 章 p. 126（PDF 143）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-abstract-truth-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-abstract-truth-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abstract-truth-set — Truth Sets for Abstract Provability Systems"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 126（PDF 143）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7c85c79ae7f29681\" href=\"?note=7c85c79ae7f29681\" title=\"92-df-abstract-provability-system\">92-df-abstract-provability-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Val}_M(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Val}_M(T)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_M\">\\(\\neg_M\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7c85c79ae7f29681\" href=\"?note=7c85c79ae7f29681\" title=\"92-df-abstract-provability-system\">92-df-abstract-provability-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq S\">\\(T\\subseteq S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthSet}_M(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthSet}_M(T)\\)</span> 为以下定义的元语言谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}truth\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TruthSet}_M(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Val}_M(T)\\land\\forall X\\in S\\;(BX\\in T\\Longleftrightarrow X\\in P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}truth\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TruthSet}_M(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Val}_M(T)\\land\\forall X\\in S\\;(BX\\in T\\Longleftrightarrow X\\in P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>真值集既须经典地解释 falsehood 与蕴涵，又须把 BX 的真值准确对齐 X 的外部可证性。这是双向的可证性语义条件，不是只说 P⊆T。一般五元组未必有这种 T；本定义没有凭空保证其存在，也不保证可由对象语言公式表达。</p>\n<p>若另有 P⊆T，才得到原书定理1所需的“每个可证元素都真”。这种性质与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bd433626d0825ffc\" href=\"?note=bd433626d0825ffc\" title=\"92-df-normal-stable-system\">92-df-normal-stable-system</a> 的 Stable 不同：Stable 限制可证集合的逆向闭包，TruthSet 限制外部解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-abstract-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"7c85c79ae7f29681","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-abstract-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"7c85c79ae7f29681","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)$，$\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)$；$\\mathrm{Val}_M(T)$ 和 $\\neg_M$ 来自 [[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-normal-stable-system","status":"resolved","id":"bd433626d0825ffc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"若另有 P⊆T，才得到原书定理1所需的“每个可证元素都真”。这种性质与 [[92-df-normal-stable-system]] 的 Stable 不同：Stable 限制可证集合的逆向闭包，TruthSet 限制外部解释。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Val}_M(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_M","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TruthSet}_M(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}truth\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TruthSet}_M(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Val}_M(T)\\land\\forall X\\in S\\;(BX\\in T\\Longleftrightarrow X\\in P).","display":true}],"bytes":1403,"backlinks":[{"id":"7c85c79ae7f29681","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书另要求 truth set 满足 BX 的真值当且仅当 X 可证，具体定义见 [[92-df-abstract-truth-set]]。valuation 本身只约束 f 和蕴涵，不能代替这一额外条件。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-truth-set]] → [[92-thm-abstract-truth-set-incompleteness]]；[[92-df-abstract-enumeration-map]] → [[92-prop-abstract-enumeration-normal-stable]] → [[92-thm-abstract-enumeration-incompleteness]]。这里的真固定点与可证固定点、Φ 枚举与外部 c.e. 枚举分别保留。"},{"id":"56ec8377fc84ab9d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-truth-set]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-truth-set]]"}],"outgoing":["7c85c79ae7f29681","bd433626d0825ffc"]}